  "details": "I uploaded a world in Unity 2019 and discovered this when viewing it in Unity 2022.\n\nThe Animate Cross-fading shader effect in LODGroup was working in 2019, but not in 2022.\n\nThe LODGroup component appears to be working to animate, but the shader does not appear to be able to animate.\n\nThe area around the shader keyword `LOD_FADE_CROSSFADE` did not seem to work well in 2022, but I cannot be sure.",
